  - name: "ConvoZen AI"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ConvoZenAI/indictelephony-bench"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/ConvoZenAI/indictelephony-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - automatic speech recognition
  - benchmark
  - telephony
  - code-switching
  - Indian languages
abstract: >-
  An open, telephony-only ASR benchmark of 25,393 human-curated utterances
  (30.18 hours) in nine Indian languages, recorded over live SIP lines and
  released at 8 kHz. 70.4% of utterances are code-mixed. This repository holds
  the scoring suite: the normalizer, five metrics and call-level bootstrap
  intervals.
